    "detailed_description": "<h1>Save Your Spot For Playtests</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/75e60afda7f758ce1327bfe631000c6c.avif?t=1753728402\" data-has-big /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brave New Wonders</strong> is a factory automation strategy simulation game with <strong>AI automatons</strong>. In a <strong>post-apocalyptic</strong> world, you can command automatons with plain text instructions in any language to explore ruins, battle with enemies, construct factories, automate production lines and build your amazing wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command Your Automatons With Text Instructions</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/8c75bf540c996dec15e719fb3d5d8ea0.poster.avif?t=1753728402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/8c75bf540c996dec15e719fb3d5d8ea0.webm?t=1753728402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/8c75bf540c996dec15e719fb3d5d8ea0.mp4?t=1753728402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the automaton army with written English instructions. Backed by a Large Language Model, you can use natural language to tell automatons what to do, and they will follow. Use your imagination to let the automatons collaborate and interact with the environment, sky is not the limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Ruins From The Last Civilization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/c9514c9cfa7a0431cdabc99d0da1ce2d.poster.avif?t=1753728402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/c9514c9cfa7a0431cdabc99d0da1ce2d.webm?t=1753728402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/c9514c9cfa7a0431cdabc99d0da1ce2d.mp4?t=1753728402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander in this post-apocalyptic world, discover ruins from the last civilization, and collect treasures to inspire your people to develop new technologies and create your brave new wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build A Unique Tech Tree</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/2a6da306b3dc827c55c73ee36a46bf48.poster.avif?t=1753728402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/2a6da306b3dc827c55c73ee36a46bf48.webm?t=1753728402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/2a6da306b3dc827c55c73ee36a46bf48.mp4?t=1753728402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear people\u2019s requests and make decisions. Your decision will affect the branching of your tech tree, it\u2019s different every time for every player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use customized instructions to command automatons to accomplish tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your factory through intelligent automation with conditional commands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the post-apocalypse world and encounter ruins from the last civilization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions when receiving requests and build unique tech trees.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About us</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City From Naught is an indie game studio based in Toronto. The name comes from our aspiration to build a city in the virtual world out of nowhere - a city that belongs to us and everyone else. We focus on creating immersive gaming experiences since 2019. Brave New Wonders features a novel gameplay. We warmly welcome everyone to join our community for all kinds of discussions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy the game!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brave New Wonders</strong> is a factory automation strategy simulation game with <strong>AI automatons</strong>. In a <strong>post-apocalyptic</strong> world, you can command automatons with plain text instructions in any language to explore ruins, battle with enemies, construct factories, automate production lines and build your amazing wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command Your Automatons With Text Instructions</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/8c75bf540c996dec15e719fb3d5d8ea0.poster.avif?t=1753728402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/8c75bf540c996dec15e719fb3d5d8ea0.webm?t=1753728402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/8c75bf540c996dec15e719fb3d5d8ea0.mp4?t=1753728402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the automaton army with written English instructions. Backed by a Large Language Model, you can use natural language to tell automatons what to do, and they will follow. Use your imagination to let the automatons collaborate and interact with the environment, sky is not the limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Ruins From The Last Civilization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/c9514c9cfa7a0431cdabc99d0da1ce2d.poster.avif?t=1753728402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/c9514c9cfa7a0431cdabc99d0da1ce2d.webm?t=1753728402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/c9514c9cfa7a0431cdabc99d0da1ce2d.mp4?t=1753728402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander in this post-apocalyptic world, discover ruins from the last civilization, and collect treasures to inspire your people to develop new technologies and create your brave new wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build A Unique Tech Tree</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/2a6da306b3dc827c55c73ee36a46bf48.poster.avif?t=1753728402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/2a6da306b3dc827c55c73ee36a46bf48.webm?t=1753728402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403830/extras/2a6da306b3dc827c55c73ee36a46bf48.mp4?t=1753728402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear people\u2019s requests and make decisions. Your decision will affect the branching of your tech tree, it\u2019s different every time for every player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use customized instructions to command automatons to accomplish tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your factory through intelligent automation with conditional commands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the post-apocalypse world and encounter ruins from the last civilization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions when receiving requests and build unique tech trees.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About us</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City From Naught is an indie game studio based in Toronto. The name comes from our aspiration to build a city in the virtual world out of nowhere - a city that belongs to us and everyone else. We focus on creating immersive gaming experiences since 2019. Brave New Wonders features a novel gameplay. We warmly welcome everyone to join our community for all kinds of discussions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy the game!</p>",
